        <mxCell id="rel_srv_snapshot" value="bản chụp giá / tên&#xa;(Snapshotting)" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;dashed=1;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeColor=#16A34A;endArrow=open;" edge="1" parent="1" source="tbl_services" target="tbl_appt_services">
